the target language is: lps.

% The smallest interesting reactive rule.
% Source: legacy_lps1/examples/CLOUT_workshop/fireSimple.pl

the maximum time is 5.

the events are:
    the fire is dealt with; known as deal_with_fire.

the actions are:
    the fire is eliminated; known as eliminate.
    everybody escapes; known as escape.

the fluents are:
    there is a fire; known as fire.

the knowledge base fire includes:

initially there is a fire.

if there is a fire at a first time
then the fire is dealt with from the first time to a second time.

the fire is dealt with from a first time to a second time if
    the fire is eliminated from the first time to the second time.

the fire is dealt with from a first time to a second time if
    everybody escapes from the first time to the second time.

when the fire is eliminated
then it is not the case that there is a fire.
